cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DAF or the PBAS architecture in your research, please cite both the software and the paper."
authors:
  - family-names: Ochinang
    given-names: Tony
    affiliation: TonyOS Lab
title: "DAF — Deterministic Agentic Framework"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-05-14
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tonyos-lab/daf"
url: "https://tonyos-lab.org"
abstract: >
  DAF is the open-source reference implementation of
  Policy-Based Agentic Systems (PBAS), a governed architecture
  for production LLM systems. DAF implements the Governed Agentic
  Loop — a closed-loop mechanism in which the LLM proposes plans,
  a deterministic Policy Engine evaluates every proposal against
  organizational policy, and an Execution Orchestrator acts
  exclusively on approved plans with runtime-scoped permissions.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - agentic AI
  - AI governance
  - policy-based systems
  - deterministic orchestration
  - enterprise AI
  - responsible AI
